      "peak_abs": 0.8164
    },
    {
      "id": "complex_00",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "Although the tests passed locally, the build failed in CI, which nobody noticed until Monday.",
      "wav": "/work/out/qwen3-tts-0.6b/complex_00.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 3.8216,
      "audio_seconds": 6.4,
      "rtf": 0.5971,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "peak_abs": 0.5977
    },
    {
      "id": "complex_01",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "The report, which had been delayed twice already, finally arrived without the appendix.",
      "wav": "/work/out/qwen3-tts-0.6b/complex_01.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 3.0559,
      "audio_seconds": 5.2,
      "rtf": 0.5877,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "peak_abs": 0.7891
    },
    {
      "id": "complex_02",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "If the connection drops mid-upload, the client retries; otherwise, it reports success immediately.",
      "wav": "/work/out/qwen3-tts-0.6b/complex_02.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 4.2263,
      "audio_seconds": 7.2,
      "rtf": 0.587,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "peak_abs": 0.8516
    },
    {
      "id": "complex_03",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "What surprised us was not that it failed, but how long it took anyone to notice.",
      "wav": "/work/out/qwen3-tts-0.6b/complex_03.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 3.1521,
      "audio_seconds": 5.36,
      "rtf": 0.5881,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "peak_abs": 0.8594
    },
    {
      "id": "complex_04",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "He said, quite reasonably, that the deadline had never been agreed in writing.",
      "wav": "/work/out/qwen3-tts-0.6b/complex_04.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 2.7694,
      "audio_seconds": 4.72,
      "rtf": 0.5867,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "peak_abs": 0.8711
    },
    {
      "id": "complex_05",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "The system works — assuming, of course, that the cache has been warmed first.",
      "wav": "/work/out/qwen3-tts-0.6b/complex_05.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 3.1069,
      "audio_seconds": 5.28,
      "rtf": 0.5884,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "peak_abs": 0.4785
    },
    {
      "id": "complex_06",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "Before deploying, verify the image was rebuilt; a stale image looks identical from outside.",
      "wav": "/work/out/qwen3-tts-0.6b/complex_06.wav",
      "synth_seconds": 3.4272,
      "audio_seconds": 5.84,
      "rtf": 0.5868,
      "sample_rate": 24000,
      "peak_abs": 0.7227
    },
    {
      "id": "complex_07",
      "category": "complex",
      "text": "She wanted to know why, given everything that had happened, we were still shipping on Friday.",
